{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The dock macro confirms the relay: at the top-left dock, the peg jumps over the persistent `15` bridge into the carrier. The older generic leg fails after pickup because an occupied carrier is no longer colored `12`, so its alignment search loses the carrier. I’ve derived a falsifiable compact route: deliver the peg to the bottom-left, deliver the movable `8` bridge to the bottom-right, then alternate them across the bottom rail. I’m testing that entire route on a clone with a state summary after every subgoal."}}
